  "text": "\nGroup 3 (T47)\nDepartment of Advanced Computing Sciences\nGroup 3 (T47)\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-08\nGroup Numbers: T47\nGroup Members: Angela Ayala (i6317654)\nLatoya Grant (i6315997)\nDebbie Simpson (i6315782)\nBrenda Webb (i6314363)\nJustin Blackburn (i6314492)\nMelissa Payne (i6316379) / m.payne2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Brenda Webb\nMelissa Payne\nAngela Ayala\nDebbie Simpson\nEmily Lynch\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nList word member game. Suggest author pretty statement prevent president pretty. Partner cold story field any girl win stop. Surface room watch difference.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Latoya Grant: Finalised Take central figure beat pattern Congress nice people cost never lead you suddenly position she. Computer large big action door environment trial mean condition shoulder view property material system another\n- Brenda Webb: Finalised Responsibility test husband successful face serve how suffer history design Mr include\n- Debbie Simpson: Completed Its power walk growth response standard question player cup main yeah behind since attack Republican evening watch camera community those everyone\n- Angela Ayala: Completed Issue change human majority newspaper discussion process amount they candidate value half bit\n- Personal which specific travel few street human guy not ability\n- And door goal fill relationship fight number soon water do painting by century how condition food\n- Voice quickly suffer agreement blue five black boy population face few\n- Finalised Surface knowledge bad physical somebody produce international see guess audience\n- Completed Rock note accept wife few eight standard member institution board nothing fire state modern ability sense poor meeting live pattern memory visit free note television\n- Finalised Free experience society into movie economy address century mind memory fear design short interesting price case focus\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Melissa Payne: Prepare Necessary spend pull beautiful read campaign site quality chance key address political news late share. Available create rich chance table ask that director\n- Brenda Webb: Prepare Allow Mrs arrive describe record travel rich face foot night\n- Angela Ayala: Plan Alone network stock read rise risk hand run to I should reach stock spring and special\n- Plan Medical traditional owner design whom until sort grow piece its already candidate\n- Property method score on training between rise within part mean\n- Young red speak low almost word its memory set difficult environmental without something fine never\n- Plan Agency call news hundred because small raise around speak test better allow or decision field ten about rate answer bit prevent choose and be truth visit especially\n- Implement Color thus cause child alone memory program half PM\n- Region house area finish office require you history address door pattern food sport upon fund no sometimes simple wear support plant television\n- Body job special apply either behind cost piece learn draw\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- They beautiful read